          "items": [
            "INLET BEACH – Playa Maya <br>​​​​​​​Private Pool & Courtyards | Steps to Rosemary | Sleeps 10 <br><br>DESCRIPTION <br>Playa Maya is a beautifully designed, three-story luxury retreat in Inlet Beach just steps from Rosemary Beach. It is conveniently located within walking distance of the shops and restaurants of 30Avenue and Rosemary Beach. With 4 bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, and over 3,000 sq ft of elegant living space, this home is perfect for families or groups seeking comfort, style, and proximity to the beach. <br><br>OUTDOOR LIVING & BEACH ACCESS <br>Enjoy rare and private outdoor spaces including a courtyard with a private pool, a private back patio for quiet dinners, and front balconies perfect for sunsets. It is a quick 4-minute walk to the sugary sands and emerald waters of the Gulf. <br><br>HOME FEATURES <br>✔ 4 bedrooms | 4 full + 1 half bathrooms | Sleeps 10 <br>✔ Private pool (heating available for an additional fee) <br>✔ Two courtyards with lounge seating and dining areas <br>✔ Elevator for easy access across all levels <br>✔ Fully equipped kitchen and ice maker <br>✔ Smart TVs in every bedroom <br>✔ Fireplace and stylish, coastal furnishings <br>✔ Walk to 30Avenue and Rosemary Beach dining and shopping <br>✔ Optional carriage house with extra bed and living area (added fee, based on availability) <br>✔ Five adult bikes included <br><br>DINING & ENTERTAINMENT <br>✔ Steps to local restaurants, coffee shops, and boutiques <br>✔ Close to all the fantastic restaurants in Inlet, Seacrest, Rosemary, and Alys Beach. <br>✔ Near Rosemary Beach Racquet Club and 30A bike trails <br><br>WHY STAY HERE? <br>✔ Ideal for families and small groups <br>✔ Unique outdoor spaces for lounging and entertaining <br>✔ Walkable location with easy beach access <br><br>SLEEPING ACCOMMODATIONS <br>✔ 3 King bedrooms <br>✔ Bedroom with two Queen beds <br><br>Playa Maya is your upscale 30A getaway combining luxury, location, and laid-back beach vibes all in one.",
